```
  <p>
    Grayz'n Buffalo Bar & Grill respects your privacy. This Privacy Policy
    explains what information this website collects, how it is used, and
    the choices available to you.
  </p>

  <h2>Information You Provide</h2>
  <p>
    If you use our contact form, we may collect the information you submit,
    such as your name, email address, phone number if provided, and the
    contents of your message.
  </p>

  <h2>How We Use Information</h2>
  <p>We use information submitted through the contact form to:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Respond to questions, comments, or requests;</li>
    <li>Communicate with you about your inquiry; and</li>
    <li>Maintain and protect the security of our website.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    We do not sell personal information or use contact-form information
    for targeted advertising.
  </p>

  <h2>Service Providers</h2>
  <p>
    We use third-party service providers to operate certain website
    functions. These providers may process information as necessary to
    provide their services.
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Cloudflare:</strong> We use Cloudflare infrastructure and
      Cloudflare Turnstile to help protect the contact form from spam,
      abuse, and automated submissions.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Resend:</strong> Contact-form submissions may be transmitted
      through Resend so that we can receive and respond to messages.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Google Maps:</strong> Our website includes an embedded map.
      Google may receive information about your interaction with the map
      under its own privacy practices.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies and Tracking</h2>
  <p>
    This website does not use advertising cookies or third-party
    advertising trackers. We do not use cookies to build advertising
    profiles or retarget visitors.
  </p>

  <p>
    Some third-party services, including the embedded Google Map and
    Cloudflare Turnstile, may process technical information necessary to
    provide their services. Their practices are governed by their own
    privacy policies.
  </p>

  <h2>Information Sharing</h2>
  <p>
    We do not sell or rent personal information. We may share information
    with service providers that help operate the website or deliver contact
    messages, or when required by law.
  </p>

  <h2>Data Retention</h2>
  <p>
    We retain contact messages only for as long as reasonably necessary to
    respond to the inquiry, maintain business records, resolve disputes,
    or meet legal obligations.
  </p>

  <h2>Your Choices</h2>
  <p>
    You may contact us to request access to, correction of, or deletion of
    personal information you submitted through the contact form. We may
    need to verify your request before taking action.
  </p>

  <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
  <p>
    This website is not directed to children under 13, and we do not
    knowingly collect personal information from children through the
    website.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this Privacy Policy as our website or practices change.
    Any updates will be posted on this page with a revised “Last updated”
    date.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact Us</h2>
  <p>
    For privacy questions or requests, contact Grayz'n Buffalo Bar & Grill
    through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>, call
    <a href="tel:+17159264431">(715) 926-4431</a>, or write to:
  </p>

  <address>
    Grayz'n Buffalo Bar & Grill<br />
    102 S Eau Claire St<br />
    Mondovi, WI 54755
  </address>
</div>
